        "cooked": "<p>Whether I like the source music or not, I’ve been finding videos like the below to be really impressive. The editing, planning, and musical aspects of these are really impressive. These are a few examples of this type of stuff that I really like. Anyone else have some favorites of the same sort of thing?</p>\n<p>Zelda 2 - “Palace Theme”</p><div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"j51CIOcdFY0\" data-video-title=\"Palace Theme Stop Motion Music\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j51CIOcdFY0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b614d1a1bad8864c7eeeca2c137c7fefe597fb0a.jpeg\" title=\"Palace Theme Stop Motion Music\" data-dominant-color=\"8F7F6E\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<p>Skrillex - “Scary Monsters and Nice Sprites”</p><div class=\"youtube-onebox lazy-video-container\" data-video-id=\"TcutAZHIiE8\" data-video-title=\" - YouTube\" data-video-start-time=\"\" data-provider-name=\"youtube\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TcutAZHIiE8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"video-thumbnail\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n    <img class=\"youtube-thumbnail\" src=\"\" title=\" - YouTube\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n",
